// MEASUREMENT SET v2 (built 2026-11-14 by a fixed rule, before any v2 result was seen). No message overlaps v1.
// Scams (30): 3 real 'relative in trouble' messages quoted (sic) by Maldita.es (to test the rule fixed after v1), the 6 DGT
//   messages not used in v1 (candidates-arita.jsonl), and 21 INCIBE bank SMS not used in v1, taken at an even stride.
// Legit (30): UCI SMS Spam Collection ham not used in v1; >=25 chars, no URL/phone/e-mail; random.Random(20261114).sample.
// KNOWN LIMITATIONS: legit messages are informal English; scam links were removed by the sources; 21/30 scams are bank SMS.
